  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Donate for community renovation in Kharale/DRC</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to renovate classrooms at Institut Tupendane, a school we started building 6 years ago that has 10 classrooms in Kharale /Bukavu. The project will also support the building of a community library, computer room, basketball court, and washrooms in the school. this will provide literacy support service and IT basic knowledge, access to sanitation as well as access to the internet to the Kharale community.</narrative>
  </description>
